hpc:SlurmJob a owl:Class .
hpc:JobID rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:SlurmJob ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:PostResponse rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmJob .
hpc:DeleteResponse rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmJob .
hpc:GetResponse rdf:type owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:SlurmJob .
hpc:JobInfoResponse rdf:type owl:Class ;

hpc:hasContent a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:PostResponse, hpc:DeleteResponse, hpc:GetResponse ;
    rdfs:range rdf:Resource .
hpc:contentSchema a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:hasContent ;
    rdfs:range rdf:Resource .
hpc:contentSchemaRef a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:contentSchema ;
    rdfs:range rdf:Resource .
```

This ontology fragment represents the classes `SlurmJob`, `PostResponse`, `DeleteResponse`, `GetResponse`, and `JobInfoResponse`. It also defines the object properties `hasContent`, `contentSchema`, and `contentSchemaRef`. The `hasContent` property represents the response content of a Slurm job, while `contentSchema` and `contentSchemaRef` are used to specify the schema of the response content.
